<p>80 − 60 = 20 km/h</p>

<p><b>Step 2:</b> Use distance = speed × time.</p>
<p>Change in distance = 20 × 3</p>

<p><b>Step 3:</b></p>
<p>Change in distance = <b>60 km</b></p>

<h3>Worked Example 2</h3>

