<td>1</td>
<td>4</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td>6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td>5</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p>
Total frequency:
</p>

<p>
4 + 6 + 5 = <b>15</b>
</p>

<p>
Therefore, the table represents 15 observations.
